{"id":"iphone","code":"<style>.iph{width:132px;height:250px;border-radius:26px;background:#0b0e13;border:3px solid #262C34;padding:8px;position:relative}\n.iph .notch{position:absolute;top:8px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:52px;height:15px;background:#000;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px;z-index:2}\n.iph .screen{width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#7A5CFF,var(--accent,#3366FF));display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font:900 20px Inter,sans-serif}</style>\n<div class=\"iph\"><span class=\"notch\"></span><div class=\"screen\">GOOD WORK.</div></div>"}